WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.003
We will now begin our moment of silence
to pay our respects to John Lennon.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:12.137
Lennon was walking in and this kid says, "John Lennon."

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.474
John was laying straight out like that.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:17.851
 No movement, nothing.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.644
This guy just shot John Lennon.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.021
The alleged killer is Mark David Chapman.
-Mark David Chapman.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:23.732
Chapman is a photographer from Hawaii.

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:26.192
And why have you never spoke about it?

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.402
I just didn't want any trouble.

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:28.778
But time's past.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.240
He actually apologized to us.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.992
He said, gee I’m sorry I ruined your night

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.453
and I said you got to be kidding me, you just ruined your whole life.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:38.496
Was somebody working with him?

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:39.831
Was it a conspiracy?

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:43.126
His intention was to bring fame to himself.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.335
Was religion a motive?

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:47.881
He said my name is Mark David Chapman. 
You’ll remember my name.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.009
Nobody's ever given peace a complete chance.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.720
Gandhi tried it, Martin Luther King tried it, 
but they were shot.

